  "details": "1. I understand for the basic user, mouse capture can irritate and interfere with the experience you wish to cultivate. (and rightly so)\n2. However, some more advanced users may need mouse look to work from time to time for various reasons, including but not limited to development.\n3. - - If I may be so bold:\nIn order to satisfy both aims, I posit a [Fallback][Cursor Capture] option in the advanced launcher.\n- - > Being a feature off by default: serves to cultivates the wider target audience, while allowing advanced or alternate features that may be needed by your more advanced users and/or potential content creator allies.\n\n- Respectfully\nSteve H.\nInternet Security and Data Forensics\nN.I.B. Mobile",
